# Wave W17-AC (Route 226): east sand — the coast road’s pale sand, design-authorised: a pale cool sand running the cliff coast from Wildreach’s roofs to Palmside’s villas, its tread carrying the grey of cliff grit washed down the slope (design: the road keeps the cliff side the whole way). Split from Route 222’s solar sand by coolth entire (cliff-pale vs sun-bleached) and from Route 221’s tide sand by office: this sand runs a cliff road, that one wanders a marsh shore.
